-- The WebAssembly cross-build of troupec is driven by cabal, because stack
-- cannot drive a cross toolchain. It builds the same package, from the same
-- hpack-generated Troupe-compiler.cabal, as the native stack build; see the
-- `compiler-wasm` target in the top-level Makefile for how it is invoked and
-- what has to be on the environment.
--
-- Only exe:troupec is ever built this way. The other executables and every test
-- suite stay native.
packages: .
